# TMDB API Key Configuration for AI Movie Recommender
# ====================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. Sign up for a free TMDB account at https://www.themoviedb.org/
# 2. Go to Settings -> API and generate an API key (v3 auth) or Read Access Token (v4 auth).
# 3. Create a file named `.streamlit/secrets.toml` in the project root.
# 4. Paste your API key below:
#
# TMDB_API_KEY = "your_32_character_tmdb_api_key_here"
#
# Note: If no API key is provided, the application will run in Fallback Mode
# using the local TMDB 10K dataset without live posters or cast information.
